  "content": {
    ".trip-hero": "\n<div class=\"hero-overlay\"><div class=\"hero-top\"><span class=\"pill gold\" id=\"demo-label\">Weymouth · next away trip</span><span class=\"pill glass\">Away day / 2026–27</span></div>\n<div class=\"matchup\"><img alt=\"Weymouth FC crest\" class=\"opponent-crest\" height=\"112\" src=\"assets/away-days/weymouth-crest.png\" width=\"112\"/><div><div class=\"hero-eyebrow\">Saturday 31 October 2026 · 15:00 GMT</div><h2 id=\"fixture-title\">Weymouth FC <span>v Tiverton Town</span></h2><p>Southern League Division One South</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"hero-bottom\"><div><strong>Bob Lucas Stadium</strong><span>Radipole Lane, Weymouth, Dorset, DT4 9XJ</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button yellow\" href=\"https://uptheterras.co.uk/tickets/?ticket_category=away-tickets&amp;ticket_product=50261\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy match tickets ↗</a><button class=\"button light\" id=\"calendar\" type=\"button\">Add to calendar</button></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"photo-credit\">Ground photo &amp; crest: Weymouth FC · <a href=\"https://uptheterras.co.uk/club-info/bob-lucas-stadium/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Club website ↗</a></div>\n",
    ".guide-toolbar": "<p>Fixture &amp; tickets checked <strong>27 October 2026</strong> · football figures refresh from our results feed.</p><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"button dark\" disabled=\"\" id=\"copy-guide\" type=\"button\">Copy programme brief</button><button class=\"button white\" id=\"print\" type=\"button\">Print / save PDF</button></div>",
    ".opposition": "\n<div class=\"section-top\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Meet the hosts</span><h2 id=\"opposition-title\">The Terras, at a glance</h2></div><button class=\"button white\" disabled=\"\" id=\"refresh\" type=\"button\">Refresh football data</button></div>\n<div class=\"football-layout\"><div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"stats\" id=\"stats\"><p>Loading the verified football snapshot…</p></div><div class=\"source-line\" id=\"football-status\" role=\"status\"></div></div><div class=\"form-box\"><h3>Last five league games</h3><div aria-label=\"Last five league results\" class=\"form\" id=\"form\"></div><div class=\"source-line\">Oldest → newest · W win / D draw / L loss</div><div class=\"home-record\" id=\"home-record\"></div></div></div>\n<details class=\"results-details\"><summary>See the five results &amp; data source</summary><div class=\"table-scroll\" id=\"recent-results\"></div><p class=\"source-line\">League games only. Scores are home first, away second; Tiverton’s score is red. League position uses the shared verified table. <a href=\"https://nickabull.github.io/Tiverton-Town-Control-Centre/league-table.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Check full league table ↗</a></p></details>\n<p class=\"upcoming\">Latest league result: Shaftesbury 1–3 Weymouth, 27 October. The football figures below refresh from the same shared results feed as the Match Centre.</p>\n",
    ".travel-section": "\n<div class=\"section-top\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">The journey</span><h2 id=\"travel-title\">Get there your way</h2></div><div aria-label=\"Travel mode\" class=\"mode-switch\" role=\"group\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\" data-mode=\"all\" type=\"button\">Compare both</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-mode=\"road\" type=\"button\">By road</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-mode=\"rail\" type=\"button\">By rail</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"travel-grid\">\n<article class=\"panel travel-card\" id=\"road-card\"><span class=\"number\">01 / ROAD</span><h3>A trip to the Dorset coast</h3><p class=\"lead\">Use <strong>DT4 9XJ</strong> for the Bob Lucas Stadium.</p><p>From Tiverton, head towards Dorchester and Weymouth via the A35/A354, then follow signs for the stadium. Let the live route planner check conditions on the day.</p><form id=\"road-form\"><label for=\"origin\">Starting town or postcode</label><div class=\"input-action\"><input autocomplete=\"off\" id=\"origin\" maxlength=\"120\" name=\"origin\" type=\"text\" value=\"Tiverton, Devon\"/><button class=\"button dark\" type=\"submit\">Update route</button></div></form><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button yellow\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=Tiverton%2C+Devon&amp;destination=Bob+Lucas+Stadium%2C+Weymouth+DT4+9XJ&amp;travelmode=driving\" id=\"drive-link\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Open live directions ↗</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://uptheterras.co.uk/club-info/directions-to-the-bob-lucas-stadium/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Local approach ↗</a></div>\n<div class=\"mini-note\"><strong>The final approach</strong><p>Follow local signs for the Bob Lucas Stadium; some signs may still say Wessex Stadium. Check parking and arrival arrangements with Weymouth before setting off.</p></div>\n<details><summary>Work out a departure time</summary><p class=\"source-line\">Your own planning allowance, not a live traffic estimate. Read the journey time in Maps, then enter it here.</p><div class=\"planning-inputs\"><label>Arrive at ground<input id=\"arrive\" type=\"time\" value=\"14:00\"/></label><label>Journey minutes<input id=\"journey\" max=\"600\" min=\"15\" step=\"5\" type=\"number\" value=\"120\"/></label><label>Extra buffer<input id=\"buffer\" max=\"180\" min=\"0\" step=\"5\" type=\"number\" value=\"30\"/></label></div><p class=\"departure\">Plan to leave at <strong id=\"leave-time\">11:30</strong></p></details>\n</article>\n<article class=\"panel travel-card\" id=\"rail-card\"><span class=\"number\">02 / RAIL</span><h3>Weymouth, then the final leg</h3><p class=\"lead\">Search outward and return trains to <strong>Weymouth railway station</strong>, allowing time for a bus or taxi to the ground.</p><label for=\"rail-origin\">Start your rail journey at</label><select id=\"rail-origin\"><option value=\"Tiverton Parkway\">Tiverton Parkway (TVP)</option><option value=\"Exeter St Davids\">Exeter St Davids (EXD)</option><option value=\"Taunton\">Taunton (TAU)</option></select><ol class=\"rail-steps\"><li><span id=\"rail-start\">Tiverton Parkway</span> → Weymouth: check the available connections</li><li>Weymouth station → Bob Lucas Stadium, approximately two miles</li><li>Allow for an onward bus or taxi and the return connection</li></ol><div class=\"rail-target\"><strong>Search Saturday 31 October</strong><span>Choose an arrival that allows for the station-to-ground transfer before the 15:00 kick-off. Check return services and engineering work; no specific trains are assumed.</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button yellow\" href=\"https://www.nationalrail.co.uk/journey-planner/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Search trains &amp; fares ↗</a><button class=\"button white\" id=\"copy-rail\" type=\"button\">Copy search details</button></div><p class=\"source-line\">Exact trains, connections and fares for 31 October need checking in the planner. <a href=\"https://www.gwr.com/travel-information/travel-updates/planned-engineering\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GWR engineering checks ↗</a></p>\n<div class=\"mini-note\"><strong>From the station</strong><p>Weymouth station is approximately two miles from the stadium. The club lists taxis from the station forecourt; check current local bus routes and stops if using the bus.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://uptheterras.co.uk/club-info/directions-to-the-bob-lucas-stadium/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Club travel information ↗</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=Weymouth+railway+station&amp;destination=Bob+Lucas+Stadium%2C+Weymouth+DT4+9XJ&amp;travelmode=walking\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">See the final walk ↗</a></div></div>\n<details><summary>Rail &amp; access notes</summary><p>Check station accessibility and the outward and return journeys before booking. Arrange accessible parking, drop-off or companion admission with Weymouth FC.</p><p>Check outward and return connections and any engineering work for Saturday 31 October.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.nationalrail.co.uk/stations/weymouth/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Station information ↗</a> · <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.gwr.com/travel-information/travel-updates/planned-engineering\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Engineering checks ↗</a></details>\n</article>\n</div>\n",
    ".practical-grid": "\n<article class=\"panel\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Arrival</span><h2>Where to park</h2><span class=\"tag reported\">Check matchday arrangements</span><p>Parking at the Bob Lucas Stadium is limited. Follow stewards and check availability, any charge and accessible parking with Weymouth FC.</p><p>Allow time to park and reach the turnstiles. Do not assume arrangements from an older fixture apply on 31 October.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Bob+Lucas+Stadium+Weymouth+DT4+9XJ\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Ground entrance on Maps ↗</a><p class=\"source-line\">Use the club’s current visitor guidance and avoid obstructing access.</p></article>\n<article class=\"panel\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Food &amp; drink</span><h2>Something at the ground?</h2><span class=\"tag reported\">Check current matchday offer</span><p>The club’s visitor information describes bar and catering facilities at the stadium.</p><p>Check the matchday menu, prices, dietary options and away-supporter access directly with Weymouth FC.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://uptheterras.co.uk/club-info/bob-lucas-stadium/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Ground facilities ↗</a><p class=\"source-line\">No menu or food prices have been assumed for this fixture.</p></article>\n<article class=\"panel\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Good to know</span><h2>Make the day easier</h2><ul class=\"useful-list\"><li>Under-13s must be accompanied by a responsible adult; check the club’s junior ticket policy.</li><li>Save your ticket to your phone and use the designated away-supporter ticket link.</li><li>Confirm access requirements, companion admission and any segregation with Weymouth FC.</li><li>Check any supporter-coach arrangements and your return journey before travelling.</li></ul><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://uptheterras.co.uk/club-info/contact/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Club contact details ↗</a></article>\n",
    ".lower-grid": "\n<article class=\"panel tickets\"><div class=\"section-top\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Match-specific prices</span><h2>Who’s coming?</h2></div><span class=\"tag verified\">Official · 27 Oct</span></div><p>Online admission calculator for <strong>Weymouth v Tiverton, 31 October</strong>. Ticket-office rates: adult £15, concession £12, youth £7; under-16 £2.</p><div class=\"ticket-inputs\"><label>Adults (18–64) <span>£14 each</span><input id=\"adult\" inputmode=\"numeric\" max=\"30\" min=\"0\" type=\"number\" value=\"1\"/></label><label>Concessions <span>£11 each</span><input id=\"concession\" inputmode=\"numeric\" max=\"30\" min=\"0\" type=\"number\" value=\"0\"/></label><label>Youth (16–17) <span>£6 each</span><input id=\"youth\" inputmode=\"numeric\" max=\"30\" min=\"0\" type=\"number\" value=\"0\"/></label><label>Under 16s (13–15) <span>£2 each</span><input id=\"child\" inputmode=\"numeric\" max=\"30\" min=\"0\" type=\"number\" value=\"0\"/></label><label>Juniors (under 13) <span>£1 each</span><input id=\"junior\" inputmode=\"numeric\" max=\"30\" min=\"0\" type=\"number\" value=\"0\"/></label></div><div class=\"ticket-total\"><span>Estimated admission total<small>Travel, food and any booking fees extra</small></span><strong aria-live=\"polite\" id=\"ticket-total\">£14.00</strong></div><a class=\"button yellow\" href=\"https://uptheterras.co.uk/tickets/?ticket_category=away-tickets&amp;ticket_product=50261\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Book away tickets with Weymouth ↗</a><p class=\"source-line\">Online match-specific prices shown. Junior ages use separate categories and must not be counted twice. Under-13s require an accompanying adult. Check eligibility and final checkout total; no tickets are reserved here.</p></article>\n<article class=\"panel\"><div class=\"section-top\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Your matchday</span><h2>Ready for the trip?</h2></div><span class=\"check-progress\" id=\"check-progress\">0 / 5</span></div><div class=\"checklist\" id=\"checklist\"><label><input data-check=\"fixture\" type=\"checkbox\"/> Recheck fixture &amp; kick-off</label><label><input data-check=\"tickets\" type=\"checkbox\"/> Tickets saved to phone</label><label><input data-check=\"travel\" type=\"checkbox\"/> Road route / outward &amp; return trains checked</label><label><input data-check=\"arrival\" type=\"checkbox\"/> Parking or taxi / final leg sorted</label><label><input data-check=\"needs\" type=\"checkbox\"/> Access or dietary questions checked</label></div><label for=\"trip-notes\">My trip notes</label><textarea id=\"trip-notes\" maxlength=\"3000\" placeholder=\"Train to catch, parking plan, who’s driving…\" rows=\"4\"></textarea><p class=\"source-line\">Notes and checks stay in this browser on this device.</p></article>\n",
